              "id": "text-14",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Aluminum Alloy 7050 | UNS# A97050 demonstrates high strength, high resistance to corrosion, high fracture toughness, and fatigue resistance. Because of these desirable characteristics, Aluminum Alloy 7050 is widely used for aircraft structure applications. This alloy exhibits better corrosion resistance and toughness than 7075 and has become the metal of choice for fuselage frames, bulkheads, and wing skins."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Aluminum Alloy 7050 Specifications:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Tempers: T7651, T7451, T74511"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "AMS: AMS 4201, AMS 4050, AMS 4342"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
